s://api.github.com/users/whoozle","html_url":"https://github.com/whoozle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whoozle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whoozle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whoozle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whoozle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whoozle/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whoozle/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whoozle/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whoozle/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whoozle/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-01-05T00:49:14Z","updated_at":"2018-01-05T11:38:53Z","body":"Could you please run ./aft-mtp-cli and then type 'properties <any-path, e.g Music>' in the prompt, and then paste it here?\r\n\r\nhere's my output:\r\n```\r\nLGE Nexus 5> properties Music\r\nproperties supported: dc01 dc02 dc03 dc04 dc07 dc09 dc0b dc41 dc44 dce0 dc4e \r\n```\r\n\r\nIt looks like both of my nexuses (android versions 7 and 8) are supporting property codes dc08 and dc4e which are 'date modified' and 'date added'. Hopefully I can add support for that. \r\n\r\nBut it could be somewhat tricky, since MTP is not telling all possible object properties, but returns them on per-object basis. \r\n\r\nI removed ctime/mtime support some time ago, because extra-request(s) (set/get ctime/mtime) per file was performance hit, but now my code utilizes more efficient batch properties request, and it should not affect performance at all. \r\n\r\nAnyway, ignore gory details and send me your properties :D I'll see what I can do for you\r\nThanks for your feedback!\r\n  \r\nPS it seems that posix requires ctime to reflect the real file creation date, and there's no API to set it, unfortunately. ","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whoozle/android-file-transfer-linux/issues/comments/355442676/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whoozle/android-file-transfer-linux/issues/comments/355540494","html_url":"https://github.com/whoozle/android-file-transfer-linux/issues/149#issuecomment-355540494","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/whoozle/android-file-transfer-linux/issues/149","id":355540494,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM1NTU0MDQ5NA==","user":{"login":"whoozle","id":480115,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MDExNQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/480115?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/whoozle","html_url":"https://github.com/whoozle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whoozle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whoozle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whoozle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whoozle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whoozle/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whoozle/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whoozle/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whoozle/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/whoozle/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-01-05T12:08:37Z","updated_at":"2018-01-05T12:09:00Z","body":"I remember now why I removed it. \r\n\r\nIf you request mtime/ctime on per-object basis, android's MTP always returns 0, and then format it as 1970-1-1-…, it's useless. \r\n\r\nThe only way I could request those properties is GetObjectPropertyList, which retrieves all properties for all children objects. :(\r\n\r\nIt's long-standing android bug","author_association":"OWNER","pin":nu